            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 27,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "I don't have the nvmesensor expertise to know if this means we'll get duplicate logs now, so hopefully someone familiar with it will review this."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 27,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Had a search\n\nhttps://github.com/search?q=org%3Aopenbmc+%2F%28%3F-i%29%22Logging%22%2F&type=code\n\nand from the search results, my assumption is that it is not used in the nvmesensor.\n\nI'm hoping for @andrew@codeconstruct.com.au to review this change to confirm that property is not used."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 27,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "I'll mark this as resolved since everyone had a month to acquire the 'nvmesensor expertise' \ud83d\ude04\n\nI had a look at nvmesensor myself and to me it does not look like it is creating any inventory related logs.\n\nIf I'm wrong, it won't be the end of the world, and we can revert the change. Otherwise we get to simplify the code here."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 27,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "@ed@tanous.net do you remember any history on this one?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 27,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Yeah, history was that NVMe drives kept getting detected even when there were \"ghost\" drives in the machine, and drives being \"added\" on every host boot.  I don't really care enough to try to support that anymore."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Added some of the config authors here to give feedback:\n\n- is this property still needed?\n- was it added to these configs intentionally, or taken from an existing config."
                },
